{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "51dcda54ea229906e2734357d5db9f9df198cc0a65f70a9d2f2d9a64e7a59cf2", "ja": "（今度の莉緒の衣装は、今までとかなりイメージが\n違う男装だ。ファンの人達には好評みたいだけど……）", "zh": "（莉绪这次的服装，是给人感觉跟以往截然不同的男装。\n而粉丝们似乎很中意的样子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "2efff52fa667749d8064d94f36e1f3ab1f48def9fbc76c50d4529fc68a921985", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くん！\nナイスタイミング♪", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}！\n你来得正好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "edcddf5ae0efae1964824dac1177fb12ed547c252a5887a5fea8ec2e6b41aa73", "ja": "莉緒、お疲れさま。何か用事だったか？", "zh": "莉绪，辛苦了。有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "52cf81f39922ad7e7bd66bce85705e981b9147c0a5a773a37c176f85215c13fb", "ja": "ちょっとね、聞きたいことがあったのよ。\n会いたいと思ってたら来てくれるなんて、さすがね！", "zh": "我有件事想跟你说。\n一这么想你就主动出现了，真是厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee8a9480fcb44c888e461fde8a993223cb4dc734f030da49401c1e040a2e2eb5", "ja": "ほら、私のブログに\nこの衣装を着た写真を載せたじゃない？", "zh": "我不是有在部落格上\n发了穿着这套服装的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9b7c8f15edaca610c06b83487aa6ff74589a87a29e6c61e471b39b64da3df2af", "ja": "ああ、うん。\nファンの人達に、案外好評みたいだな。", "zh": "嗯，有啊。\n粉丝们好像出乎意料地喜欢呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "aac947f4b75c26f5b3a70527825dc5dcb69d9276f266f803ae78e0b52c470374", "ja": "そう！　それなのよ！\nどうしてなのかしら？　わからないわ～。", "zh": "没错！我要说的就是这个！\n这是为什么呀？我不懂～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "030ebf4799ea97773117faafde154be438bca6e7ac379f253cda0b4c887334d6", "ja": "どうしてって……\n莉緒も気に入ってるって書いてたじゃないか。", "zh": "还问我为什么……\n莉绪你自己也写了很喜欢不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "2b4e1713d170a313930a8448583dd0e02adae91b72fb76acb331d8f425667ded", "ja": "ウフフ、そうなの！　こういう、男装とか？\n女の子が好きなのはわかるんだけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，对啊！像这样的男装，\n受女生喜爱是能理解的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "9b4a97a0b4188d667bd318d10dba4cfa14a09689989b45c78f0d9ff013dd8fb5", "ja": "でもネットの反応とか見てると、男の子たちも\n意外とよろこんでくれてるみたいだから。", "zh": "但从网路上的反应来看，\n男生好像也出乎意料地喜欢耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "012edb8863ea745a84b2b21cc5c5de844c63612f487076f925b0f482e2f05fad", "ja": "セクシーってほどじゃないのに……どうしてかしら？\nねえ{$P$}くん、わかる？", "zh": "这明明称不上是性感……到底是为什么呀？\n我说{$P$}，你能理解吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6e1ea636626f5e0ddb7044946346b3780954b96e635f4eed0a88cb108b798eab", "ja": "なんだ、そういうことか。\nそれはやっぱり……新鮮な魅力だからじゃないかな？", "zh": "什么嘛，原来你想问这个。\n原因当然是……觉得有股全新的魅力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "5bd7ab117048cae4a265c0286f515b02e37f4b22485c5e0c3f188adb1801124b", "ja": "新鮮な魅力……男装が？\n{$P$}くん、もっと詳しく教えて！", "zh": "全新的魅力……男装吗？\n{$P$}，再讲得详细点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1a381a71cab541e39e8d42ac0a6929c176f2cfc353e8406a9e91711be855b707", "ja": "詳しくって言われても、そのままの意味だけど……\n今回の男装は、普段とは違う莉緒の姿なわけだし。", "zh": "也没什么更详细了，就是字面上的意思……\n毕竟这次的男装，和平时的莉绪很不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "25c155fc1c6ff9e87a8c4ec4465baa757c99f137fa6460f493f546c69be4a5de", "ja": "そういう意外な一面が見られるのって、\nうれしいものじゃないか？", "zh": "可以看到这样意外的一面，\n当然会开心不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "2b46a32e3afeb1ae49453c2672b4fc232ed11854ba8c1dc8fcde355b888cba13", "ja": "なるほど、そういうコトだったのね……。\n{$P$}くんも、新鮮だと思った？", "zh": "原来如此，是这样呀……\n{$P$}也觉得这样很新鲜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4652a912140e554f601a376a7d74469a08b3cb88bb57cb8a789c1e86d9334110", "ja": "もちろん。\n莉緒の、新しい可能性を感じたよ。", "zh": "当然呀，\n让我觉得莉绪之后有新的可能性呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "086dbfda76a6050139c6fa36b5a650d2dd1fa0056bb7ea4f240d750c5c71c0e9", "ja": "そう？\nじゃあ、せっかくだから……ん、ん。", "zh": "是吗？\n那么，机会难得……嗯、嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "6c8bc61d821136fdbff5ca0d7a4ca04ba68286fb7b8fc13f9ffcbd8e42d01ef4", "ja": "やあ、{$P$}くん。\n僕だよ、悠利だ。", "zh": "嗨，{$P$}。\n是我，我是悠利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6408d682aacfed62daacd79f9017caa8246e674a6ca1cde98107c1e8c1992a46", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ？　いきなり。", "zh": "你、你怎么啦？这么突然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "c328aca66449f324d097a1f097db21baaa28bd985861f1236909268349c9db62", "ja": "ふふっ。これなら{$P$}くんも、\n新鮮さを感じるんじゃないかと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，我在想这样{$P$}是不是\n也会觉得很新鲜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "0c89c91bedbb6a9e23b7f25d80921dd24e0e0da4c268c813d726adf27d169ce3", "ja": "どうだろう、新鮮かな？\nキミがドキドキしてくれたら、僕はうれしいんだけど。", "zh": "怎么样？有新鲜感吗？\n你要是有觉得小鹿乱撞，我会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3274fb399146093e0dacfb2a82fa18b8ad4b71da1ba11a8af9baeea087e95b71", "ja": "いや、なんというか……。口調が違うだけで、\n莉緒は莉緒にしか見えないかな……。", "zh": "呃，该怎么说……就只是换了说话方式而已，\n莉绪看起来还是那个样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "c4efa6b016b5c6170c9a78a1342be45dfbbaf72651c5a59dbe970d3528c2cf48", "ja": "えーっ！？\nじゃあ、どうやってアピールしたらいいのよ～。", "zh": "咦──！？\n那你说我该怎么呈现才好啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d5b8b8b36e3b14197fe5fea50305c34ca74bc3d1c84e78928cb36e4e273d1c06", "ja": "別に無理しなくていいと思うんだけど……\n自然体じゃダメなのか？", "zh": "用不着勉强自己吧……\n就照你平时的样子不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "e80c8085473965a2fa813d3e8f3545018454d2d926356946ce11c7a7e618cf46", "ja": "あん、それはダメよ！\nせっかく見つけた、新しい私の魅力なんだから！", "zh": "讨厌，那可不行！\n这可是我好不容易才发现的新魅力耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0084_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "c54d9abd6d3e8c17a2d62db49464cfca97d35eab09d3f4e5a40994b181b790f9", "ja": "この衣装に合った、最高のアピールを身につけなきゃ！\n付き合ってよね、{$P$}くん♪", "zh": "我得学会最棒的表现方式，让自己配得上这套服装！\n陪陪我吧，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
